OL,3,GNEWSAFamily tribute to 'kind' dad
OL,4,Akilled in Lidl crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a father-of-two killed
OL,7,Fafter a car crashed through the
OL,8,Fentrance of a Lidl supermarket have
OL,9,Fpaid tribute to his "kindness,
OL,10,Fgenerosity and wonderful sense of
OL,11,Fhumour".
OL,13,FJames Singh Jagpal, 39, was pronounced
OL,14,Fdead at the scene of the crash in
OL,15,FWolverhampton, which emergency services
OL,16,Fwere called to just before 18:00 BST on
OL,17,FFriday.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,360,350,200,160,0,100
