OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSAFamily tribute to 'kind' dad
OL,4,Akilled in Lidl crash
OL,5,
OL,6,F"James was the absolute centre of our
OL,7,Fworld, and it is unimaginable how we
OL,8,Fwill navigate life without him by our
OL,9,Fside," his family said in a statement
OL,10,Fissued by police.
OL,12,FThey added: "We would like to express
OL,13,Four sincere gratitude to the staff,
OL,14,Fcustomers and emergency services who
OL,15,Fimmediately came to James's aid at the
OL,16,Fscene."
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
